description_text:
This pack includes 5 low-poly medieval swords with PBR textures for Games and CGI.
Include FBX files with textures in 4K. The pack also includes Unity(HDRP and URP) and UE4 versions.
The polycount is within 4000-4800 triangles, only Rust sword contain 6358 tris.
Each sword contains the following textures:

  - BaseColor map;

  - Normal map;

  - Metallic map;

  - Roughness map;

  - Mask map for HDRP(Smothness & Metallic);

  - Mask map for URP(Smothness & Metallic);

  - Mask map fo Unreal Engine 4&5(Roughness & Metallic);

- This archive consists of concrete hemisphere barrier model saved in four different formats (.max, .obj, .fbx, .tbscene) and the textures.

  - This model can be used for games, movies, virtual reality, advertising, render scenes, design, etc.

  - Concrete Hemisphere Barrier size:
  - Diameter  - 0,6 m;

  - Height - 0,3 m.

  - Sidewalk sold separately.

  - There are additional textures for Unity and Unreal Engine.

  - This archive has only basic materials for 3ds max and marmoset.

  - Rendered in Marmoset Toolbag 3.

  - Waiting for your comments and suggestions!

  - This scene includes one object:

  - concrete hemisphere barrier pack 1.

  - Textures resolution:   - concrete hemisphere barrier pack 1: 2048x2048.

  - Textures format: TGA.

  - Textures:    - color (diffuse);

  - gloss;

  - metalness;

  - normal;

  - normal inv (invert green channel);

  - ao (ambient occlusion).

  - Textures for Unity:

  - specular metallic (specular map in alpha channel);

  - normal inv (invert green channel).

  - Textures for Unreal Engine:

  - roughness;

  - ORM (Occlusion – red channel,  Roughness – green channel,  Metallic – blue channel).

  - Additional textures:

  - paint mask (b&w mask of painted areas).

  - LODs:
  - concrete hemisphere barrier pack 1

  - lod0 - tris: 912, edges: 2736, verts 458;

  - lod1 - tris: 416, edges: 1248, verts 210;

  - lod2 - tris: 144, edges: 432, verts 74;

  - lod3 - tris: 64, edges: 192, verts 34.

